WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.099
"Is Dog big or little?" asked Pig.

2
00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:18.370
"I think he's big," said Cow.

3
00:00:18.371 --> 00:00:22.070
"What will Dog do?" Bat asked.

4
00:00:22.071 --> 00:00:30.523
"He is a watchdog," said Cow.

5
00:00:30.524 --> 00:00:33.488
"Dog will watch the farm.

6
00:00:33.489 --> 00:00:38.737
He will keep it safe," said Cow.

7
00:00:38.738 --> 00:00:43.069
"He will not keep me safe," said Cat.

8
00:00:43.070 --> 00:00:46.796
"Dogs do not like cats."

9
00:00:46.797 --> 00:00:50.655
"Some dogs like cats," said Cow.

10
00:00:50.656 --> 00:00:58.960
"No, they don't!" said Cat.

11
00:00:58.961 --> 00:01:15.962
Soon Cat left the barn.

12
00:01:15.963 --> 00:01:19.588
She saw a truck.

13
00:01:19.589 --> 00:01:24.310
The truck came closer and closer.

14
00:01:24.311 --> 00:01:27.773
Then Dog got out!

15
00:01:27.774 --> 00:01:33.235
"Woof! Woof!" said Dog.

16
00:01:33.236 --> 00:01:37.146
"I must hide!" said Cat.

17
00:01:37.147 --> 00:01:39.972
"I must hide now!"

18
00:01:39.973 --> 00:01:44.983
Cat looked around.

19
00:01:44.984 --> 00:01:53.326
She saw a tall tree.

20
00:01:53.327 --> 00:02:00.103
Cat ran to the top.

21
00:02:00.104 --> 00:02:03.942
"This is a good place," said Cat.

22
00:02:03.943 --> 00:02:09.726
"Dog will not get me here!"

